From 39e5a2075a62ba4843a744c088b34e4f5ab69a2c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Van Tran <trantoanvan@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 12:09:50 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(index): store block ids and highlight flags per chunk,
 make chunk size configurable

Each chunk records the Obsidian block id that ends it (^abc) and whether it
holds highlighted text (==text== or <mark>). Search anchors expose both when
present. OBSIDIAN_CHUNK_TOKENS lowers the chunk size below the model limit;
the setting is part of the index identity, so changing it rebuilds the index.
Without it chunking and results are unchanged. Schema version 3 backfills
anchors for existing chunks from their stored text.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
